# M13 "Üç Yurt", flow "zones_hunt" run 1 (StartZone = 0, real time): a new Aydor warrior leaves
# Tanyeri Burcu through the north-west of the town and fights one of the new homeland monsters, an
# Anız Yanığı (docs/WORLD_ZONES_ART.md §4): its name and level on the nameplate, its attack clip, the
# death clip on the ground, then the loot bag and the loot window.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m13_hunt_a
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Avci
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+zone2 1800
waitfor world+ready+nobanner 600
# Out of the town towards the north-west pack (just beyond the curtain wall).
scene walkpath 197 340
waitfor world+nodest+standing 3600
waitfor world+monsters 600
scene walktomonster Anız Yanığı 8
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
expect world+outsidesafe
scene target nearest Anız Yanığı
scene camera behind 26 8
wait 20
expect world+target+targetmonster
screenshot 25_tanyeri_stubble_thrall_target.png
key f
waitfor world+attacking+ownhits1 900
waitfor world+hitstaken1 900
scene camera side 24 6
wait 6
screenshot 26_tanyeri_stubble_thrall_fight.png
waitfor world+kills1 2400
expect world+alive
wait 45
scene camera side 30 6
wait 5
screenshot 27_tanyeri_stubble_thrall_corpse.png
waitfor world+lootvisible+lootmine 300
key e
waitfor world+lootwin+lootcontents 600
expecttext loot.contents Akçe
scene camera side 30 6
wait 10
screenshot 28_tanyeri_loot.png
scene combatlog
quit
